  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know, healing Pokémon is a specialty of\nmine, working at a Pokémon Center and all.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nSo I decided to share my skills with my team!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What I mean is that I taught my Pokémon moves\nthat can restore HP!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074002000490020006D00650061006E002000690073002000740068006100740020004900200074006100750067006800740020006D007900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006D006F007600650073000A0074006800610074002000630061006E00200072006500730074006F00720065002000480050002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Impressive, right? I wonder if a Trainer like you\ncould take on my self-healing team and win.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tell me any time if you think you’d like to have a\nPokémon battle with me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you think you can take on my self-healing\nteam and win?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F00200079006F00750020007400680069006E006B00200079006F0075002000630061006E002000740061006B00650020006F006E0020006D0079002000730065006C0066002D006800650061006C0069006E0067000A007400650061006D00200061006E0064002000770069006E003F00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Absolutely!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100620073006F006C007500740065006C007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maybe not...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610079006200650020006E006F0074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, if you don’t have confidence in your team’s\npower, it’s probably best not to push them.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then taste the despair of watching your opponent\nrecover just when you thought you’d won!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What an overwhelming offense! And such\nmenacing tenacity!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200061006E0020006F007600650072007700680065006C006D0069006E00670020006F006600660065006E00730065002100200041006E006400200073007500630068000A006D0065006E006100630069006E0067002000740065006E00610063006900740079002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Of course, you can’t win by focusing only on\nrecovery.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI made sure to keep that in mind when selecting\nmy team’s moves, yet here we are!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve got no choice but to admit how strong you\nare—and how weak I still am.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I’m a Pokémon Center worker! My true skills\nlie in healing Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So if you don’t mind, I’ll fix up my Pokémon’s\ninjuries right away!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F00200069006600200079006F007500200064006F006E201900740020006D0069006E0064002C002000492019006C006C00200066006900780020007500700020006D007900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E20190073000A0069006E006A0075007200690065007300200072006900670068007400200061007700610079002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I have to admit: it’s a funny feeling to heal my\nown team like I do the teams of other Trainers!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“Heliolisk and the rest of my team should be\nall better now!” Tee-hee!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And of course I’ll be happy to heal your team any\ntime you stop by!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2768,
